These files are the official SRBench evaluation pipeline. We run them
unchanged so our results are bit-for-bit comparable to the published benchmark.

License: GPLv3 (as inherited from srbench). This `srbench_upstream/` subpackage,
and the `driver.py` that imports it, are therefore GPLv3 in combination. The rest
of this repository (`libs/symbolic`, `hypotheses/*`) does NOT import srbench and
remains under its own license; SRBench consumes those packages downstream.

Files (copied from `experiment/`):
  evaluate_model.py        — numeric eval + symbolic model extraction
  assess_symbolic_model.py — gated symbolic recovery vs ground truth
  symbolic_utils.py        — clean_pred_model, round_floats, complexity, get_sym_model
  read_file.py             — PMLB .tsv.gz loader
  utils.py                 — jsonify helper
  metrics/evaluation.py    — simplicity metric

